              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Hooterschick"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This recipe had way too much onion in it, though it was a good base. I added about 1/2 cup sour cream and 1tbs sugar to cut the onion flavor. Tasted great after the additions...love the white cheddar.",
            "datePublished": "2009-05-06T16:59:59.307Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
